libspectrum
------------------------------------------
libspectrum is a library designed to make the input and output of some ZX
Spectrum emulator files slightly easier.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libaudiofile1-0.3.6-2
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libgcrypt20-1.12.4-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.0-1
  libspectrum-devel-1.7.0-1bl1
  libspectrum21-1.7.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libaudiofile-devel-0.3.6-2
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libgcrypt-devel-1.12.4-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  http://fuse-emulator.sf.net/libspectrum.php

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/fuse-emulator/libspectrum-1.7.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libspectrum-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libspectrum-1.7.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libspectrum-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libspectrum-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libspectrum21-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libspectrum-devel-1.7.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libspectrum)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libspectrum.README
  /usr/share/doc/libspectrum/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libspectrum/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libspectrum/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libspectrum/README
  /usr/share/doc/libspectrum/THANKS

(libspectrum21)
  /usr/bin/cygspectrum-21.dll

(libspectrum-devel)
  /usr/include/libspectrum.h
  /usr/lib/libspectrum.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libspectrum.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libspectrum.3.gz

